Rule 2 (torch.pow API requires non-negative exponent when input dtype is int)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int ⊎ float} |= if 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5 then v_2 ≥ 0
